  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gor&#xe9;e Institute, phase 1</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gor&#xe9;einstitutet, fas 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gor&#xe9;e-institutet &#xe4;r ett pan-afrikanskt institut som grundades 1992. Det &#xe4;r en faciliterande organisation som avser att bygga allianser kring m&#xe5;len att fr&#xe4;mja valreform, politisk dialog, fredsbyggande, intressegruppsutveckling samt kulturell utveckling i Afrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gor&#xe9;e Institute is a Pan-African institute founded in 1992. It is a facilitative organisation which intends to build alliances around the objectives of promoting electoral reform, political dialogue, peace building, community development and cultural development in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
